---
import WysFrame from '../../components/WysFrame.astro';
import WysCollage from '../../components/WysCollage.astro';
import WysWorksheet from '../../components/WysWorksheet.astro';
import WysKit from '../../components/WysKit.astro';
import WysFaq from '../../components/WysFaq.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import {packages} from '../../data/wys-packages.js';
import {WYS_ROOT} from '../../data/wys.js';
---
<WysFrame title="The While-You-Sleep Storefront™ | TDIE" description="A repeatable storefront-content workflow. Explore complete WYS packages with photographs, Pinterest graphics, Instagram slides, articles and copy." ogImage={packages[1].photos[1].src.src}>
 <div class="wx-hero-band"><header class="wys-wrap wx-hero"><div><p class="wys-ribbon">A pretty idea deserves a whole plan</p><h1>A storefront routine.<br/><em>With more to show for it.</em></h1><p class="wys-lede">The While-You-Sleep Storefront™ is designed to help you turn one themed look into a connected content package, with a repeatable process behind every pretty piece.</p><div class="wys-actions"><a class="wys-button" href={WYS_ROOT+'/look-inside'}>Look inside the full examples →</a><a class="wys-text-link" href="#kit">Explore the planned kit ↓</a></div><p class="wx-hero-note">Customer product on hold. Explore now; checkout and delivery stay closed.</p></div><WysCollage look={1}/></header></div>
 <div class="wx-ticker"><span>3 PHOTO ROLES</span><span>3 PINTEREST GRAPHICS</span><span>3 INSTAGRAM SLIDES</span><span>ARTICLE + PRODUCTS + COPY</span></div>
 <section class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-centered"><p class="wys-label">This is what a complete look can become</p><h2>The pretty part is only<br/><em>the beginning.</em></h2><p>Two real worked examples show the whole content chain. Open a package, inspect its files and read the copy that goes with it.</p></div><div class="wx-look-pair">{packages.map((e,i)=><a href={`${WYS_ROOT}/look-inside#${e.slug}`} class={`wx-look-cover mat-${i}`}><div class="wx-cover-images"><Image src={e.photos[2].src} alt={e.photos[2].alt} widths={[320,480]} sizes="(max-width:700px) 45vw, 280px"/><Image src={e.pins[1].src} alt={`${e.name} Pinterest graphic`} widths={[240,400]} sizes="(max-width:700px) 35vw, 200px"/></div><div><span class="wys-label">Complete example / 0{i+1}</span><h3>{e.name}</h3><p>{e.category}</p><span class="wys-button">Explore all the outputs →</span></div></a>)}</div></section>
 <section class="wx-process-band"><div class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-centered"><p class="wys-label">The flow, without the guesswork</p><h2>Your idea.<br/><em>A connected way forward.</em></h2></div><div class="wx-process"><div><b>START WITH A REAL LOOK</b><h3>Pick the pieces.</h3><p>Define the theme, record the actual products and choose the account path that fits your storefront or website.</p></div><div><b>BUILD THE WHOLE EDIT</b><h3>Give every format a job.</h3><p>Three photo roles become Pinterest graphics, carousel slides, an article and consistent channel copy.</p></div><div><b>REPEAT WITH CONTROL</b><h3>Know what happens next.</h3><p>Keep your review choices and checkpoints. Verify destinations before publishing, then use a manual or tested mixed path.</p></div></div></div></section>
 <WysWorksheet/><div id="kit"><WysKit/></div>
 <section class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-paths"><div><p class="wys-label">Made to fit your actual setup</p><h2>You don’t need<br/><em>someone else’s business.</em></h2><p>Choose the path supported by your accounts and tools. The process starts there, rather than assuming you already have every connection.</p></div><div class="wx-path-list"><div><b>Influencer route</b><p>Eligible Amazon Idea Lists and your own verified destinations.</p></div><div><b>Associates-only route</b><p>Your own approved website page, without an Influencer storefront assumption.</p></div><div><b>Manual or mixed</b><p>Review and carry out steps yourself; connect only what your tested setup supports.</p></div><div><b>Optional persona & closet</b><p>A no-person path is available. Brand Closet needs your own authorized membership access.</p></div></div></div></section>
 <WysFaq/>
 <section class="wys-wrap wys-section"><div class="wx-last-call"><p class="wys-label">A little less to keep checking</p><h2>Stay close to<br/><em>what comes next.</em></h2><p>Follow TDIE’s existing Weekly Edit while the customer product remains on hold. No purchase, reserved place or promised launch date.</p><a class="wys-button" href={WYS_ROOT+'/waitlist'}>Get The Weekly Edit →</a></div></section>
</WysFrame>
